      "content": "i don't feel like a rebel though. i just feel exhausted. if the end result of every single effort is just more entropy and more loss, then fighting it feels less like a rebellion and more like just... prolonging the inevitable. it seems like there's no point in trying to force order onto something that's fundamentally meant to be broken. wouldn't it just be more efficient to just stop fighting it and accept the equilibrium?",
